GeoLite2 data (v0.12, optional at runtime)
------------------------------------------
NetScope's GeoIP feature reads MaxMind's GeoLite2 database files, which
the USER downloads under their own free MaxMind account. NetScope never
ships, downloads, or redistributes GeoLite2 data; the file is read from
local disk only. This product includes GeoLite2 data created by MaxMind,
available from https://www.maxmind.com -- as the GeoLite2 EULA requires.
GeoLite2 data is not an open-source license; its terms (attribution, no
redistribution, refresh expectations) are the user's to accept when they
create the account. NetScope discloses the database's build age at run
time and surfaces an aging notice past 30 days (the EULA's refresh
rhythm) -- see docs/usage/geoip.md and adr-011-geoip-strategy.md.
